doc.Dispose();

// Later:
var heads = syncState.SharedHeads;  // NO disposal check on _state!
byte[]? msg = doc.GenerateSyncMessage(syncState);  // Crashes: doc._disposed = true
```

The sync state persists but tries to use disposed document context.

